I have escalated this, and a qualified adviser will contact you. The switchboard number is 0117 496 0100.

We will need:
- the original or a certified copy of the death certificate;
- details of the executors or administrators of the estate;
- the grant of probate or letters of administration (in Scotland, Confirmation) before assets can be released.

Where the total value held with us is below £30,000 we can usually release assets to the personal representatives without a grant, against a signed indemnity. We provide a date-of-death valuation for the estate free of charge.
